LineID,Quest,Stage,Topic,Speaker,VoiceType,Emotion,Value,Text,Conditions,Notes
NHV_SYS_BOOK_1,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"THE GLEANER'S LEDGER\n\nA name is not a summons. It is a question written down before anyone decides whether to ask it.",,Buch für die Ledger Room; wird nach dem Memorial und vor Q01 übergeben.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_2,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"I keep names because memory is a poor lock. It opens for grief, closes for pride, and lets the most convenient story walk out wearing the truth's face.",,Seite 1; Veyras Arbeitsmethode.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_3,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"First mark the deed. Then mark the silence after it. A killer who can describe the blood but not the hour afterward has told you only half a story.",,Seite 1; keine pauschale Eignungsregel.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_4,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Second: watch what remains when anger has spent itself. Remorse is not proof. Cruelty is not proof. The choice that follows is the part worth carrying to the Listener.",,Seite 2; Listener entscheidet über Aufnahme.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_5,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Third: never mistake hunger for devotion. The Dark Brotherhood needs hands that choose the knife, and minds that know when to put it away.",,"Seite 2; Veyras Deutung, keine universelle Sithis-Lehre."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_6,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"I have served Sithis in more than one house. The doors bore different names. The silence beyond them did not.",,"Seite 3; fraktionsübergreifende Tätigkeit angedeutet, keine konkrete Morag-Tong-Tatsache."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_7,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,The Mother speaks to her Listener. The Listener judges those I bring to the door. I offer names not commands.,,"Seite 3; Zuständigkeiten von Night Mother, Listener und Veyra."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_8,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"When a sanctuary burns, count what can still be taught. Count the doors that remain. Count the people who have not yet learned to call themselves lost.",,Seite 4; Veyras Wiederaufbau-Motiv.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_9,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"First inquiry: Hjaalmarch. Hrefna Stormhollow, a Nord farmer, performed the Black Sacrament against the moneylender taking her farm. No answer came.",,"Seite 5; Q01-Anker nach Hrefnas Autorenprofil; ihre Tat und das Schicksal des Geldverleihers bleiben offen."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_10,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"She waited six weeks. Her husband drank, the cupboards emptied, and grief learned the shape of work. Begin in Morthal. Ask what the marsh returned.",,"Seite 5; Q01-Anker nach Hrefnas Autorenprofil; keine vorweggenommene Mordszene."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_11,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Do not offer a place before you have heard the petitioner's story. Find the fisherman who remembers the water. Learn why the town calls the death an accident.",,"Seite 6; Hakan Reed-Walker als erster Ermittlungsanker; Veyra bleibt externe Helferin."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_12,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"If this ledger outlives me, let its keeper cross out every certainty I mistook for wisdom. A record that cannot be corrected is only another kind of lie.",,Seite 6; Mysterium und Veyras Fehlbarkeit.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_13,Q00,50,DiaryOfAshAndDoors,Book,-,Neutral,50,"DIARY OF ASH AND DOORS\n\nNo date. The ash had settled before I arrived. Someone had swept a path through it, then denied having hands.",,Eigenes Buch in der Deep Sanctuary; rätselhafter Veyra-Text ohne Datierung.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_14,Q00,50,DiaryOfAshAndDoors,Book,-,Neutral,50,"A child asked whether I belonged to the house. I asked which house she meant. She pointed to the one behind her, though there was only sky.",,Seite 1; keine direkte Herkunftserklärung.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_15,Q00,50,DiaryOfAshAndDoors,Book,-,Neutral,50,"I remember a voice before I remember a face. It told me that a closed door is still an answer. I have spent years deciding whether that was kindness.",,Seite 2; Veyras Verhältnis zu Türen und Schweigen.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_16,Q00,50,DiaryOfAshAndDoors,Book,-,Neutral,50,"The candle burned blue when I lied. It burned black when I told the truth. On the third night it burned without a flame, and I stopped asking it to choose.",,"Seite 2; mystisches Bild, keine technische Regel."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_17,Q00,50,DiaryOfAshAndDoors,Book,-,Neutral,50,"I left a name beneath the floorboard. When I returned, the wood was bare and the name was waiting in my mouth. I did not write it down again.",,Seite 3; absichtlich nicht auflösbares Rätsel.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_18,Q00,50,DiaryOfAshAndDoors,Book,-,Neutral,50,"If this is found, do not ask when it was written. Ask why the ink has not dried. Some answers are only dangerous because they arrive before the question.",,Seite 3; Schluss des Tagebuchs.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_19,Q00,50,NotesOnSithis,Book,-,Neutral,50,"SITHIS, AS I WAS TAUGHT\n\nSome call him the Void. Some call him the Dread Father. Some call the name a cage built by frightened mouths.",,Persönlicher theologischer Text; widersprüchliche Tamriel-Traditionen.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_20,Q00,50,NotesOnSithis,Book,-,Neutral,50,"I was taught that Sithis is not the dark between things. He is the change that makes the space between them matter.",,"Seite 1; Veyras persönliche Deutung, keine objektive Kosmologie."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_21,Q00,50,NotesOnSithis,Book,-,Neutral,50,"The Brotherhood asks for a god who listens. I learned to serve a father who does not need to answer. That difference keeps a knife from becoming a prayer.",,Seite 2; Veyra wahrt religiöse Mehrdeutigkeit.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_22,Q00,50,NotesOnSithis,Book,-,Neutral,50,"When a life ends, the Void does not applaud. When a life changes, the Void does not forgive. It opens, and what enters is ours to carry.",,Seite 2; keine Behauptung über Sithis' universellen Willen.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_23,Q00,50,NotesOnSithis,Book,-,Neutral,50,"If you need certainty, kneel elsewhere. I have found only loyalty: a direction chosen again after every answer fails.",,Seite 3; Veyras freiwillige Treue.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_24,Q00,50,NotesOnSithis,Book,-,Neutral,50,"The father in the prayer is older than the order that speaks his name. Whether that makes the order wise or merely late is a question for another page.",,Seite 3; Trennung von Sithis und Brotherhood-Geschichte.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_25,Q00,50,HarvestUnderBlackStars,Book,-,Neutral,50,"THE HARVEST UNDER BLACK STARS\n\nThe old story says the field was empty until the first hand reached into the dark and found a seed that had never been planted.",,Harvest-Legende; bewusst als überlieferte Geschichte markiert.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_26,Q00,50,HarvestUnderBlackStars,Book,-,Neutral,50,"The seed became a tree, the tree became a shadow, and the shadow learned the names of those who had mistaken hunger for destiny.",,Seite 1; Veyras Erntemotiv.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_27,Q00,50,HarvestUnderBlackStars,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Every harvest leaves a gleaner behind. The reaper takes the fruit. The gleaner finds the fallen grain and asks whether it still remembers the field.",,"Seite 2; Herkunft des Titels Gleaner als Legende, nicht als belegte Chronik."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_28,Q00,50,HarvestUnderBlackStars,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Some say the gleaner serves the farmer. Some say the gleaner serves the soil. The oldest version says the gleaner serves the season that comes after.",,Seite 2; konkurrierende Deutungen.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_29,Q00,50,HarvestUnderBlackStars,Book,-,Neutral,50,"When the field burns, the harvest is not saved by pretending the grain is unhurt. It is saved by finding what can still take root.",,Seite 3; Veyras Wiederaufbau-Motiv.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_30,Q00,50,HarvestUnderBlackStars,Book,-,Neutral,50,"The story ends before the new field rises. Every teller leaves that page blank. A full ending would only be another field with no room for us.",,Seite 3; offenes Ende.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_31,Q00,50,SanctuaryFieldNotes,Book,-,Neutral,50,"FIELD NOTES: SANCTUARIES\n\nA sanctuary is not a room beneath a road. It is the agreement that a person may sleep while another person keeps watch.",,Praktische Veyra-Notizen; auf mehrere Sanctuarys übertragbar.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_32,Q00,50,SanctuaryFieldNotes,Book,-,Neutral,50,"First sign of failure: everyone knows who is to blame. Second sign: nobody knows who is responsible. Third sign: the candles are trimmed, but no one prays.",,Seite 1; Beobachtung statt historischer Behauptung.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_33,Q00,50,SanctuaryFieldNotes,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Keep a table large enough for one more chair. A family that cannot make room has already begun to count itself dead.",,Seite 2; Wiederaufbau und Zugehörigkeit.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_34,Q00,50,SanctuaryFieldNotes,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Do not seal every passage. A hidden door is useful until it becomes the only way out. Leave one route for the living and one for the truth.",,Seite 2; Bezug auf die Deep Sanctuary.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_35,Q00,50,SanctuaryFieldNotes,Book,-,Neutral,50,"When the last survivor says the family is finished, ask who taught them to count. Numbers are obedient. Rooms are not.",,Seite 3; Veyras Skepsis gegenüber endgültigen Urteilen.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_36,Q00,50,SanctuaryFieldNotes,Book,-,Neutral,50,"A keeper who never leaves the ledger becomes its prisoner. Walk the halls. Hear the doors. Let the names become faces before you decide what they owe you.",,Seite 3; Veyras Selbstkritik.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_37,Q00,50,TheFivefoldSilence,Book,-,Neutral,50,"THE FIVEFOLD SILENCE\n\nOne tale says a mother offered five children to the dark. Another says the tale was written by five children who needed a mother.",,Night-Mother-Legende; widersprüchliche Überlieferung ausdrücklich erhalten.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_38,Q00,50,TheFivefoldSilence,Book,-,Neutral,50,"A third tale says there were no children at all, only five names spoken over a bowl of ash. The bowl was real. That is the only part every teller keeps.",,Seite 1; keine Festlegung auf eine genealogische Wahrheit.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_39,Q00,50,TheFivefoldSilence,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Years later, a voice called one listener from the dark. The others heard nothing. They built an order around the silence and called it proof.",,Seite 2; Night-Mother-/Listener-Tradition.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_40,Q00,50,TheFivefoldSilence,Book,-,Neutral,50,"If the mother was a woman, the title remembers her. If the mother was a story, the title remembers us. Both can be true until someone mistakes memory for a witness.",,Seite 2; Lore-Mehrdeutigkeit.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_41,Q00,50,TheFivefoldSilence,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Keep the names if you must. Keep the doubt as well. A family built on one unquestioned story will eventually sacrifice its living to protect the dead.",,Seite 3; Verbindung zu Veyras Grundsätzen.
NHV_SYS_BOOK_42,Q01,20,HrefnaFarmLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"HREFNA STORMHOLLOW'S FARM LEDGER\n\nSpring: two sacks of barley lost to rain. One axle split. Eirik says the debt has grown teeth.",,"Fundort Q01 Stage 20; Hrefnas alter Hof; keine Questlogik."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_43,Q01,20,HrefnaFarmLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Summer: the north field held. My husband did not. He drinks before noon and calls it courage when I ask him to stop.",,"Seite 1; Hrefnas Ehemann und die finanzielle Belastung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_44,Q01,20,HrefnaFarmLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Autumn: Eirik marked the west field with red chalk. He says a mark is not a sentence. He has never had to live beneath one.",,"Seite 2; Eiriks Pfändungsdrohung wird angedeutet."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_45,Q01,20,HrefnaFarmLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Winter: I counted the flour twice. I counted the arrows three times. I did not count the days until I began to fear the answer.",,"Seite 2; Hrefnas praktische, schuldgeprägte Stimme."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_46,Q01,20,HrefnaUnsentLetter,Book,-,Neutral,50,"UNSENT LETTER\n\nTo the Mother in the dark: Eirik Ashmark is taking the farm, the animals, and whatever is left of my husband's name. I ask for an answer.",,"Fundort Q01 Stage 20; Hrefnas Black Sacrament wird als Bitte, nicht als Lösung dargestellt."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_47,Q01,20,HrefnaUnsentLetter,Book,-,Neutral,50,"I have followed the words as they were given. Heart, skull, flesh, bones, nightshade. I do not know whether the order matters. I only know that I did it alone.",,"Seite 1; Ritualdetails ohne neue Lorebehauptung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_48,Q01,20,HrefnaUnsentLetter,Book,-,Neutral,50,"If someone comes, let them come before the roof goes. If no one comes, let the dark at least remember that I asked.",,"Seite 2; Night Mother bleibt im Hintergrund und antwortet nicht sichtbar."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_49,Q01,20,HrefnaUnsentLetter,Book,-,Neutral,50,"I cannot keep waiting. The flour is nearly gone. If no one comes, I will have to do something myself.",,"Seite 2; leitet Hrefnas spätere eigene Entscheidung ein."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_50,Q01,30,HrefnaMoorJournal,Book,-,Neutral,50,"NOTES FROM THE MOOR\n\nDay seven: no answer. Eirik sent another boy to measure the fence. The boy would not meet my eyes.",,"Fundort Q01 Stage 30; nach der ersten Untersuchung des Hofs."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_51,Q01,30,HrefnaMoorJournal,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Day twenty-one: my husband drank through the morning and slept through the rain. I put the knife away. Then I put it somewhere else.",,"Seite 1; Hrefnas Schwanken zwischen Handlung und Zurückhaltung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_52,Q01,30,HrefnaMoorJournal,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Day forty-two: the answer did not come. I found Eirik at the waterline, laughing at the deed in his hand. I asked him to give it back.",,"Seite 2; unmittelbare Vorgeschichte des Mordes, aber kein vollständiger Ablauf."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_53,Q01,30,HrefnaMoorJournal,Book,-,Neutral,50,"He said the farm was already his. I keep writing that he slipped. I keep crossing it out.",,"Seite 2; starker Verdacht statt vorgezogenem Geständnis; Hrefnas persönliche Einordnung bleibt Stage 40."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_54,Q01,30,HrefnaMoorJournal,Book,-,Neutral,50,"I washed the cup. Scrubbed the table. There is always something that needs cleaning. It helps until I stop.",,"Seite 3; Schuld, Trauer und die Beziehung bleiben offen."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_55,Q01,20,EirikDemandNotice,Book,-,Neutral,50,"NOTICE OF DEBT\n\nTo Hrefna Stormhollow: payment is overdue. The west field, livestock, tools, and dwelling are collateral against the outstanding sum.",,"Fundort Q01 Stage 20; Eiriks Forderungsschreiben."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_56,Q01,20,EirikDemandNotice,Book,-,Neutral,50,"You have been granted one final extension. Do not mistake patience for mercy. The mark will be made public when the next moon turns.",,"Seite 1; Eiriks Macht über den Hof."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_57,Q01,20,EirikDemandNotice,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Bring the keys to my office in Morthal. Bring your husband if he can stand. Bring no priest, no guard, and no story about bad harvests.",,"Seite 1; Drohung ohne neue Nebenfigurgeschichte."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_58,Q01,20,EirikDemandNotice,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Eirik Ashmark. This notice will be retained with the account.",,"Seite 2; Abschluss des Forderungsschreibens; gemeinsam mit 055–057 in Stage 20."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_59,Q01,60,QuintusFieldNote,Book,-,Neutral,50,"FIELD NOTE – HJAALMARCH\n\nLocals call Ashmark's death an accident. No witness will speak plainly.",,"Fundort Q01 Stage 60; Quintus' Unterlagen."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_60,Q01,60,QuintusFieldNote,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Hrefna Stormhollow: Nord farmer. Farm seized for debt. Husband reportedly drinking heavily. Defensive when questioned. Do not approach her without a second route out.",,"Seite 1; Quintus beobachtet Hrefna, versteht sie aber nur teilweise."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_61,Q01,60,QuintusFieldNote,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Ritual remains indicate a deliberate petition. No Brotherhood contact confirmed. Watch the farm and question anyone asking after Ashmark.",,"Seite 2; Quintus bleibt bei beobachtbaren Hinweisen und offenen Ermittlungsfragen."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_62,Q01,60,QuintusFieldNote,Book,-,Neutral,50,"If the woman killed Ashmark, she may be useful to the Brotherhood. If she did not, someone else is using the marsh to hide a better story.",,"Seite 2; Quintus ist Ermittler, kein allwissender Erzähler."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_63,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"LEDGER ENTRY: HREFNA STORMHOLLOW\n\nCandidate: Nord woman, farmer, Hjaalmarch. Last known home: a small holding outside Morthal. Begin there if the townspeople cannot tell you where she went.",,"Erweiterte Q01-Ledgerfassung; Profil- und Ermittlungsdaten, kein neues Questziel."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_64,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"When I first watched the farm, it was being emptied. Barley, tools, animals, and finally the right to stand beneath one's own roof had been measured against a debt.",,"Hjaalmarch-Eintrag; Eiriks Pfändungsdruck als frühere Beobachtung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_65,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Creditor: Eirik Ashmark. Moneylender, Morthal. His notices use patience as a threat and legality as a locked door. He prefers witnesses who need wages.",,"Eirik-Profil; keine zusätzliche Oculatus-Verbindung vor Q01."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_66,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Household condition: husband drinking heavily, courage performed loudly before noon. Hrefna counts flour, arrows, and unpaid days. She does not count her own exhaustion until it becomes a weapon.",,"Hrefna-Profil; Beobachtung ihrer Schuld- und Versorgungslogik."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_67,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"She performed the Black Sacrament. No answer came. Whatever failed between her prayer and our arrival, she was left to bear the waiting.",,"Sithis/Night-Mother-Lore bleibt mehrdeutig; keine Behauptung über göttliche Ablehnung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_68,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Six weeks is long enough for hope to become a chore. It is also long enough for a person to mistake endurance for permission. Ask what she did with the time.",,"Q01-Untersuchungsfrage; keine vorweggenommene Tatbeschreibung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_69,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"The marsh keeps records without ink. Footprints fill. Water carries weight. A town chooses the word accident when the truth would require a name.",,"Moor- und Morthal-Motiv; führt zur Untersuchung des Todesfalls."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_70,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Find Hakan Reed-Walker first. He knows the marsh. Ask what he noticed, and what made him decide to keep it to himself.",,"Q01-Ermittlungsanker; Hakan als Nebenfigur aus dem Autorenprofil."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_71,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Search the farm before you seek Hrefna. When you find her, begin with what she lost, not what you suspect.",,"Gesprächsführung für Q01; Hrefnas Perspektive vor der Prüfung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_72,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"If she killed Ashmark, the act may have begun in grief and continued by choice. If she did not, grief has still taught her how to hide a wound.",,"Veyras offene Hypothese; keine vorweggenommene Auflösung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_73,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"If she killed him, ask whether she could choose the work without that first grievance. Another death alone would tell us little.",,"Q01-Prüfungskriterium; knüpft an Hrefnas Schwäche und die E23-Arbeitsweise an."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_74,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Do not mistake a full account for a true one. Let Hrefna contradict this page. I recorded what I observed, not everything she is.",,"Veyras Fehlbarkeit; der Listener soll selbst urteilen."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_75,Q00,60,TheGleanersLedger,Book,-,Neutral,50,"Record after the meeting: listen for the moment she stops speaking about what happened and begins speaking about what she chose. That is where the recruit begins.",,"Notiz für die spätere Q01-Auswertung; keine automatische Entscheidung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_76,Q00,60,MemorialPlaques,Book,-,Neutral,50,"FESTUS KREX\n\nA sharp tongue, a practiced hand. His place at the table remains.",,"Activator Record NHV_Act_Q00_PlaqueFestus (003DA1); Name: Festus Krex. Epitaph für spätere Lesefunktion."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_77,Q00,60,MemorialPlaques,Book,-,Neutral,50,"GABRIELLA\n\nA measured voice, a practiced blade. The family remembers both.",,"Activator Record NHV_Act_Q00_PlaqueGabriella (003DA2); Name: Gabriella. Epitaph für spätere Lesefunktion."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_78,Q00,60,MemorialPlaques,Book,-,Neutral,50,"ARNBJORN\n\nThe beast served the family. The man beside it was family too.",,"Activator Record NHV_Act_Q00_PlaqueArnbjorn (003DA3); Name: Arnbjorn. Epitaph für spätere Lesefunktion."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_79,Q00,60,MemorialPlaques,Book,-,Neutral,50,"VEEZARA\n\nA hidden blade, a measured breath. His enemies learned too late where the dark began.",,"Activator Record NHV_Act_Q00_PlaqueVeezara (003DA4); Name: Veezara. Epitaph für spätere Lesefunktion."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_80,Q00,60,MemorialPlaques,Book,-,Neutral,50,"ASTRID\n\nShe led this family. Her failures do not erase her name.",NHV_AstridMemorial == 1,"Activator Record NHV_Act_Q00_PlaqueAstrid (003DA5); Name: Astrid. Wahl 1, große Plakette bei den anderen."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_81,Q00,60,MemorialPlaques,Book,-,Neutral,50,"ASTRID\n\nRemembered, but not honored. Her name remains where the family can see it.",NHV_AstridMemorial == 3,"Kein eigener Activator-Record; verwendet NHV_Act_Q00_PlaqueAstrid (003DA5). Wahl 3, kleine Plakette darunter; abweichender Text für spätere Lesefunktion."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_82,Q02,70,OculatusDispatch02,Book,-,Neutral,50,"PENITUS OCULATUS — EASTERN HARBOR\n\nObserve the laborers who move after the bell. Offer fair measure before asking for names. A frightened witness is a door; a grateful one is a key.\n\nArgonian workers: record shifts, debts, quarrels, and absences. Do not call this persecution. Call it prevention. Forward all patterns to the northern desk under seal.",,"Oculatus-Fragment 2; liegt bei Aelius. Der Text bestätigt das Informantennetz, ohne Aelius' Freundlichkeit als vollständig gespielt zu entwerten."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_83,Q02,10,ReedWalkersKnot,Book,-,Neutral,50,"REED-WALKER'S KNOT\n\nFlat hitch. Marsh cord. It holds when wet and loosens when the hand remembers where to pull.",,"Lesetext für NHV_MISC_ReedWalkersKnot; optionales Beweisstück, kein Questfortschritt allein."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_84,Q02,100,DrownedPoolInscription,Book,-,Neutral,50,"THE DROWNED POOL\n\nBreathe before you enter. Leave no name to the water that you are unwilling to carry back out.",,"Kurze Inschrift für NHV_Act_DrownedPoolNameBowl; Raum-Lore nach erfolgreicher Rekrutierung."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_85,Q01,60,OculatusDispatch01,Book,-,Neutral,50,"PENITUS OCULATUS — HJAALMARCH\n\nSubject: repeated Black Sacrament activity. Record the petitioner, the named target, the local witness, and any surviving household. Do not intervene before the pattern is confirmed.\n\nForward copies to the northern desk. A prayer unanswered is still a signal.",,"Oculatus-Fragment 1; Quintus' dispatch, im Besitz des Spielers nach dem Fund."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_86,Q01,30,HrefnaDiaryExcerpt,Book,-,Neutral,50,"HREFNA'S DIARY — SIXTH WEEK\n\nThe wick burned out before the answer came. I lit another. I wrote the words again. The page stayed dry.\n\nTomorrow I go to the bog. I will ask him once. Then I will stop asking.",,"Optionaler Tagebuchauszug; verdichtet Hrefnas Warten, ohne Eiriks Tod direkt zu erklären."
NHV_SYS_BOOK_87,Q01,100,BogwifesKnife,Book,-,Neutral,50,"BOGWIFE'S KNIFE\n\nA narrow blade, blackened at the spine and bright at the edge. It was made for roots, reeds, and work that must be finished quietly.",,"Flavortext für NHV_Weap_BogwifesKnife; Q01-Recruit-Belohnung."
